WEBVTT

00:13.179 --> 00:14.431
Lady Tamayo?

00:17.851 --> 00:20.020
Good evening, Tamayo.

00:21.312 --> 00:25.358
It's dangerous to leave
a window open at night.

00:27.485 --> 00:31.031
Still, the moon is beautiful tonight.

00:32.198 --> 00:33.742
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:33.825 --> 00:38.038
I am the messenger of Kagaya Ubuyashiki.

00:42.125 --> 00:45.587
You're suspicious of me.
It's understandable.

00:46.296 --> 00:52.886
As expected, it's difficult for me
to gain your trust as Tanjiro did.

00:54.095 --> 00:56.347
What are his intentions?

00:56.431 --> 01:00.477
Is Ubuyashiki trying to deceive me?

01:02.312 --> 01:03.897
Where is Yushiro?

01:03.980 --> 01:07.192
There is no need to worry about Yushiro.

01:07.275 --> 01:11.112
Listen, you can hear
his footsteps running.

01:11.738 --> 01:14.657
Lady Tamayo! Lady Tamayo!

01:14.741 --> 01:18.161
Lady Tamayo!

01:20.330 --> 01:21.623
Now…

01:22.248 --> 01:24.292
I shall tell you my business.

01:25.043 --> 01:26.711
In the Demon Slayer Corps,

01:26.795 --> 01:31.800
there is also a kid who is knowledgeable
about the demon body and pharmacology.

01:31.883 --> 01:36.763
We would like you to look into
Nezuko's transformation together with her.

01:39.599 --> 01:43.394
In order to defeat Muzan Kibutsuji,
would you work with us?

01:45.313 --> 01:47.857
We invite you to the Ubuyashiki residence.

01:49.734 --> 01:54.697
I, a demon, am invited to the
Demon Slayer Corps headquarters?

01:56.199 --> 01:59.327
I look forward
to hearing good news from you.

02:04.457 --> 02:05.708
Lady Tamayo!

02:08.878 --> 02:10.296
Lady Tamayo.

02:12.132 --> 02:13.466
Yushiro.

02:13.550 --> 02:17.095
Let's get out of here quickly.
The preparations are ready.

02:17.846 --> 02:19.097
No need.

02:21.182 --> 02:26.062
Now that Nezuko has overcome the sun,
something big has begun to stir.

02:26.938 --> 02:32.068
No, maybe it was already in motion
before that.

02:33.403 --> 02:40.034
The events of that day
have finally culminated in this day.

02:42.120 --> 02:43.746
And perhaps…

02:43.830 --> 02:46.040
Lady Tamayo, could it be…

02:46.124 --> 02:49.002
It's true that we're moving
out of this place.

02:49.085 --> 02:52.297
But now, it's different
from what we've done.

02:52.380 --> 02:56.759
I'll quickly summarize
the research results so far.

02:56.843 --> 02:58.887
I need your help, Yushiro.

03:00.263 --> 03:04.350
This might be the last time we move.

03:07.896 --> 03:11.107
Let's go to
the Demon Slayer Corps headquarters.

03:11.691 --> 03:13.401
To the Ubuyashiki residence.

03:14.402 --> 03:17.864
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

03:17.947 --> 03:21.159
It's time to show you the answer

03:21.242 --> 03:27.540
Beyond the endless spiral

03:43.348 --> 03:46.768
The reason why it sounded like an excuse

03:46.851 --> 03:50.313
A weakness that draws in a fleeting future

03:50.396 --> 03:55.526
You mistake it for strength

03:56.903 --> 03:58.738
So detestable, so detestable

03:58.821 --> 04:00.782
So disgraceful, so disgraceful

04:00.865 --> 04:03.910
The heart that is so bleak

04:03.993 --> 04:05.745
So dark, so dark

04:05.828 --> 04:07.705
That it almost hides the moon

04:07.789 --> 04:11.292
If only you weren't here

04:11.376 --> 04:14.921
It sways and sways

04:15.004 --> 04:18.508
Carrying on its intentions
Just like a flower

04:18.591 --> 04:21.928
Taking it all away, taking it all away

04:22.011 --> 04:25.390
It tears the heart just like a storm would

04:25.473 --> 04:28.977
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

04:29.060 --> 04:32.522
It's time to show you the answer

04:32.605 --> 04:37.902
Beyond the endless spiral

04:37.986 --> 04:42.115
Who awaits there

04:45.285 --> 04:50.039
EPISODE 2: THE SORROWS OF
THE WATER HASHIRA, GIYU TOMIOKA

04:53.835 --> 04:55.420
Master Ubuyashiki.

04:57.255 --> 05:00.758
"Tanjiro, how are your injuries?"

05:03.094 --> 05:07.932
"How unfortunate
that now I'm unable to move."

05:10.351 --> 05:13.062
"Actually, I want to have a chat
with Giyu,

05:13.896 --> 05:16.024
but I can't."

05:18.109 --> 05:20.778
"Because now is an important time,

05:20.862 --> 05:25.658
we must unite together and do our best."

05:27.160 --> 05:30.830
"Would you please talk to Giyu?"

05:32.874 --> 05:37.462
"I hope you will talk to Giyu patiently,

05:38.421 --> 05:40.131
who always ends up alone,

05:40.840 --> 05:44.969
so that he can look forward."

05:48.014 --> 05:49.223
Giyu.

05:50.975 --> 05:52.101
All right!

05:56.272 --> 05:57.356
Huh?

05:57.440 --> 06:01.110
Where are you going this early, Tanjiro?

06:01.194 --> 06:02.278
Aoi.

06:02.361 --> 06:05.239
To take the Hashira Training,
by any chance?

06:05.323 --> 06:08.659
Before that,
there's someone I have to meet.

06:10.661 --> 06:12.497
If so, that would be okay.

06:14.040 --> 06:15.083
Aoi!

06:15.166 --> 06:16.459
Yes? What is it?

06:16.542 --> 06:19.754
If you don't mind,
I have a question for you.

06:21.422 --> 06:22.465
Sure.

06:24.342 --> 06:27.220
Let's say, there's someone
who is always alone.

06:27.887 --> 06:34.310
How do I convey to this person
that he is not alone?

06:36.062 --> 06:38.856
Well, I don't really know myself.

06:38.940 --> 06:43.486
Let me ask this first,
you want to cheer that person up, right?

06:44.904 --> 06:48.741
If it was me, I'd like to be left alone.

06:50.701 --> 06:52.620
Are you going now?

06:52.703 --> 06:53.704
Yes.

06:54.330 --> 06:56.082
Please wait a minute.

06:59.377 --> 07:01.838
Is it only one person you want to meet?

07:01.921 --> 07:02.964
Yes.

07:09.137 --> 07:11.013
This is difficult.

07:13.683 --> 07:16.602
It's not much, but I've prepared onigiris.

07:17.437 --> 07:20.481
It's for you and for the person
you want to meet.

07:20.565 --> 07:23.526
Before anything else,
you have to first eat properly,

07:23.609 --> 07:26.404
so that you can keep
your mind and body healthy.

07:27.196 --> 07:29.657
Aoi, thank you!

07:30.366 --> 07:31.451
I'm going!

07:40.042 --> 07:41.294
Excuse me!

07:41.919 --> 07:43.296
Tomioka!

07:43.963 --> 07:45.381
Hello!

07:46.215 --> 07:47.842
Pardon me!

07:48.593 --> 07:51.804
Giyu! It's me!

07:51.888 --> 07:53.514
Are you inside?

07:54.390 --> 07:56.601
It's me, Tanjiro Kamado!

07:57.185 --> 07:58.936
Hello!

07:59.979 --> 08:01.689
I'm coming in then!

08:03.191 --> 08:04.358
"Coming in"?

08:05.067 --> 08:07.153
No. It must be "leaving."

08:08.112 --> 08:09.780
I must have misheard.

08:19.832 --> 08:23.586
That's the story, and everyone's
already taking the training.

08:23.669 --> 08:25.004
I know.

08:25.087 --> 08:27.465
You knew? Good.

08:29.342 --> 08:30.843
So close.

08:30.927 --> 08:34.055
I'll be allowed to return to active
in seven days.

08:34.138 --> 08:36.098
Could you train me?

08:36.182 --> 08:37.391
No.

08:37.475 --> 08:38.768
Why not?

08:39.435 --> 08:44.106
You smell a bit angry.
What are you angry about?

08:44.982 --> 08:48.361
I'm angry that you didn't master
Water Breathing.

08:49.529 --> 08:53.241
You were supposed to be the Water Hashira.

08:54.075 --> 08:56.285
I'm sorry about that.

08:56.369 --> 08:59.372
But I have talked to Mr. Urokodaki.

08:59.455 --> 09:03.501
He said it isn't unusual
to change the breathing style

09:03.584 --> 09:05.753
or to create a new breathing derivation.

09:06.254 --> 09:09.715
Especially Water Breathing,
its techniques are close to basics,

09:09.799 --> 09:12.051
so many derivatives were created from it.

09:12.134 --> 09:14.053
That's not what I meant.

09:14.929 --> 09:17.265
Since there's currently no Water Hashira,

09:17.348 --> 09:21.143
someone must become the Water Hashira
as soon as possible.

09:22.019 --> 09:25.856
There's no Water Hashira? Isn't that you?

09:27.275 --> 09:29.819
I'm not the Water Hashira.

09:36.325 --> 09:37.410
Leave.

09:43.082 --> 09:47.003
"I hope you will talk to Giyu patiently."

09:48.629 --> 09:49.755
All right!

09:51.340 --> 09:52.758
Giyu!

09:52.842 --> 09:56.470
I have onigiris. Wanna eat it together?

09:57.138 --> 10:00.725
They say you become calmer
when you're full.

10:02.351 --> 10:04.604
I'll put it here.

10:17.950 --> 10:20.286
Giyu, good morning.

10:21.162 --> 10:24.123
So you ate the onigiris? I'm glad.

10:27.585 --> 10:28.669
Giyu!

10:33.299 --> 10:36.385
Giyu! Are you on a mission, Giyu?

10:36.469 --> 10:40.139
Are you on a mission, Giyu?
Is it patrolling?

10:40.222 --> 10:43.934
It seems the demons
haven't appeared that much recently.

10:45.144 --> 10:47.938
No demons here. That's good.

10:48.022 --> 10:50.191
Come on, train me.

10:51.192 --> 10:54.487
Giyu! Will you hold a training session?

10:54.570 --> 10:55.988
Please!

10:56.072 --> 11:00.117
Everyone's waiting! Giyu!

11:00.201 --> 11:02.620
Giyu. Giyu! Giyu.

11:02.703 --> 11:05.039
Giyu!

11:05.706 --> 11:06.749
LAVATORY

11:06.832 --> 11:08.125
Giyu!

11:12.546 --> 11:15.716
Will this continue
for the rest of my life?

11:17.009 --> 11:20.721
Will he stop haunting me if I talk to him?

11:26.310 --> 11:30.356
To tell the truth,
I didn't pass the Final Selection.

11:32.024 --> 11:35.653
You mean, the test at the mountain
with wisteria flowers?

11:36.946 --> 11:38.322
That's right.

11:38.406 --> 11:44.370
That year, there was a boy whose family
was killed by demons, just like me.

11:45.121 --> 11:46.539
His name was Sabito.

11:46.622 --> 11:51.043
I took the selection together with him,
a boy with peach-colored hair.

12:03.139 --> 12:05.683
Sabito and Giyu.

12:07.810 --> 12:09.353
We were 13 years old.

12:10.187 --> 12:14.733
We quickly became friends because
we were the same age and were alone.

12:15.693 --> 12:20.781
Sabito was a kind boy
who had a strong sense of justice.

12:26.829 --> 12:31.625
The only one who died
in the selection that year was Sabito.

12:33.627 --> 12:38.174
He almost defeated all the demons
on that mountain single-handedly.

12:40.551 --> 12:43.804
But everyone passed except him.

12:46.182 --> 12:52.605
I was injured and dazed by
the first demon that attacked me.

12:55.941 --> 13:00.362
Even then, Sabito saved me.

13:00.446 --> 13:04.700
Water Breathing, Fourth Form:
Striking Tide.

13:19.632 --> 13:23.135
Sabito entrusted me to another boy

13:23.219 --> 13:26.096
and went towards the voice
calling for help.

13:32.269 --> 13:35.856
The next thing I knew,
the selection was over.

13:37.608 --> 13:41.403
Somehow I survived seven days
and passed the selection.

13:42.530 --> 13:46.575
Can you really say that someone
who hadn't defeated a single demon

13:46.659 --> 13:50.371
and had only been saved actually "passed"?

13:55.876 --> 13:58.796
I'm not worthy
of becoming the Water Hashira.

14:00.172 --> 14:01.465
In the first place,

14:01.549 --> 14:05.553
I can't stand shoulder to shoulder
with the other Hashiras on equal terms.

14:07.179 --> 14:08.931
I'm different from them.

14:10.015 --> 14:13.602
Properly speaking, I have no place
in the Demon Slayer Corps.

14:15.729 --> 14:19.567
Ask another Hashira to train you.
That would be best.

14:21.068 --> 14:22.820
The mark won't appear on me.

14:23.696 --> 14:26.574
Although it might have on Sabito.

14:28.659 --> 14:32.079
Don't bother with me.
You're just wasting your time.

14:37.960 --> 14:42.965
I'm sure Giyu wishes
that he would have died.

14:44.675 --> 14:49.597
I know how painful it is to have
someone you care about die before you,

14:50.973 --> 14:53.225
and you wish
they had lived instead of you.

14:54.101 --> 14:57.271
Especially if they died protecting you.

14:58.355 --> 15:00.190
It feels like being torn apart.

15:03.235 --> 15:07.364
Sabito was the boy
who trained me on Mount Sagiri.

15:08.407 --> 15:10.492
It was a mysterious experience.

15:10.576 --> 15:14.955
They were supposedly already dead,
but they helped me.

15:16.916 --> 15:18.125
I see.

15:18.208 --> 15:21.545
Sabito took the Final Selection
together with Giyu.

15:22.922 --> 15:26.300
If he were still alive,
he would be the same age as Giyu.

15:27.551 --> 15:29.595
That's incredible, really.

15:30.554 --> 15:33.140
He saved everyone at the Final Selection.

15:34.224 --> 15:35.893
I couldn't do that.

15:35.976 --> 15:38.187
I was too busy defending myself.

15:39.188 --> 15:43.442
If he had lived, he would definitely
have been a great swordsman.

15:45.945 --> 15:50.991
It must be another reason why Giyu
thinks he should have died instead.

15:52.326 --> 15:55.537
I know it very well
because I thought the same thing.

15:56.997 --> 15:58.248
Rengoku was…

15:59.041 --> 16:03.128
an incredible person who protected us
at the cost of his own life.

16:04.088 --> 16:06.590
He was kinder and stronger
than anyone else.

16:07.633 --> 16:09.635
It was a splendid, his way of life.

16:11.220 --> 16:12.846
Until the end, he was amazing.

16:15.975 --> 16:20.062
I thought it might've been better
if I'd died instead of Rengoku.

16:21.355 --> 16:25.442
Because I believe that Rengoku might have
been able to defeat Muzan someday.

16:26.443 --> 16:27.611
However…

16:27.695 --> 16:29.613
He said he believed in you,

16:29.697 --> 16:32.950
so just think about how
you're going to measure up to that!

16:33.033 --> 16:35.202
Yeah. That's right.

16:36.036 --> 16:37.079
That's it.

16:37.162 --> 16:39.873
But what should I say to Giyu?

16:40.916 --> 16:43.293
No matter how pathetic
or humiliated you feel,

16:43.377 --> 16:45.254
you still have to go on living.

16:45.337 --> 16:47.506
Even though he doesn't admit it,

16:47.589 --> 16:49.591
Giyu must have beaten himself up

16:49.675 --> 16:52.928
and trained so hard
until he became a Hashira,

16:53.012 --> 16:55.723
and how much pain he has gone through.

16:56.765 --> 16:58.767
I don't have the right to criticize him

16:58.851 --> 17:01.603
because I don't know anything
about him, but…

17:01.687 --> 17:05.232
But there's one thing I must ask,
no matter what.

17:05.315 --> 17:07.359
Giyu.

17:07.443 --> 17:09.445
He won't stop.

17:10.571 --> 17:11.989
Giyu.

17:12.072 --> 17:18.120
Don't you want to carry on
what Sabito entrusted you?

17:30.466 --> 17:32.593
Sabito?

17:32.676 --> 17:35.846
Don't you ever say
that you wish you had died again!

17:35.929 --> 17:39.767
If you do, we're done.
I'll stop being your friend.

17:40.476 --> 17:43.729
Your sister was going to get married
the next day,

17:43.812 --> 17:48.108
but she chose to hide and protect you
from a demon although she knew the risk.

17:48.192 --> 17:52.362
You're her brother.
Of all people, don't disrespect her death!

17:52.446 --> 17:55.115
You have to stay alive.

17:56.033 --> 17:59.203
For your sister,
who sacrificed her life to save yours

17:59.286 --> 18:01.163
and to give you a future,

18:01.246 --> 18:02.623
you have to carry on.

18:03.373 --> 18:04.583
Giyu.

18:05.334 --> 18:06.585
That hurt.

18:07.753 --> 18:12.049
Suddenly I remember clearly
the shock and pain caused by his slap.

18:14.676 --> 18:16.220
Why did I forget…

18:17.930 --> 18:20.015
that exchange with Sabito?

18:21.016 --> 18:22.601
Isn't that something important?

18:29.108 --> 18:31.026
I didn't want to remember it.

18:31.860 --> 18:33.987
Because my tears would never stop.

18:41.662 --> 18:43.122
If I remembered it,

18:43.205 --> 18:46.875
I would become so sad
that I couldn't do anything.

18:48.043 --> 18:49.711
Tsutako.

18:49.795 --> 18:51.046
Sabito.

18:52.506 --> 18:54.133
I'm sorry I'm so immature.

18:56.593 --> 18:59.429
This is bad. Now he's not moving at all.

19:00.347 --> 19:03.016
What should I do? Did I say something bad?

19:03.100 --> 19:06.270
Giyu already seemed pretty depressed.

19:06.353 --> 19:08.313
Did I rub salt in his wound?

19:09.565 --> 19:12.818
I know! Maybe we could have
an eating contest.

19:12.901 --> 19:18.448
Maybe if I win,
he'll cheer up and train me.

19:18.532 --> 19:23.453
I can't ask for sparring because I don't
have permission to return to active.

19:23.537 --> 19:27.207
Since Giyu is quiet, we won't need to talk
during an eating contest.

19:27.291 --> 19:28.792
What a great idea!

19:29.459 --> 19:32.671
Tanjiro, sorry for the late response.
I will participate--

19:32.754 --> 19:35.591
Giyu, wanna have a soba eating contest?

19:37.384 --> 19:38.552
But why?

19:45.058 --> 19:49.396
So, about the training,
I haven't heard anything from Kocho.

19:50.230 --> 19:52.232
What training is she giving them?

19:54.401 --> 19:55.652
Shinobu, huh?

19:56.653 --> 19:58.155
I haven't heard about it.

19:59.114 --> 20:00.908
I wonder what her training is.

20:01.825 --> 20:04.077
Calm down. It's all right.

20:06.413 --> 20:09.082
Sis, help me to calm down.

20:10.667 --> 20:13.503
Only immature ones
can't control their emotions.

20:14.713 --> 20:16.173
Only immature ones.

20:22.679 --> 20:24.806
Master, you're back.

20:25.974 --> 20:29.811
I will be taking
the Wind Hashira's training.

20:30.771 --> 20:31.939
I see.

20:32.022 --> 20:35.943
Can I take your training
after I take Stone Hashira's training?

20:37.778 --> 20:41.949
I will not be able to participate
in the Hashira Training this time.

20:43.450 --> 20:45.160
But… But why?

20:47.329 --> 20:49.414
Kanao, come here.

20:51.500 --> 20:52.626
Okay.

20:56.171 --> 20:58.715
Well…

20:59.591 --> 21:03.345
I want to train with you more, Master.

21:07.432 --> 21:12.688
Now you're getting better at expressing
what's on your mind, Kanao.

21:13.397 --> 21:14.815
It's a good sign.

21:15.983 --> 21:18.485
I think now is the right time.

21:21.613 --> 21:26.785
I will tell you about the demon
who killed my sister Kanae.

21:28.787 --> 21:34.668
And I shall tell you
how to kill that demon.

21:42.217 --> 21:46.513
The flame that burns heaven

21:46.596 --> 21:53.395
Truer than the truth

21:53.478 --> 21:57.607
The voice of prayers and
The sounds of shouting

21:57.691 --> 22:04.156
Are fleeting like winged insects

22:04.239 --> 22:08.869
Why do those who devour lives

22:08.952 --> 22:15.876
Beg mercy as if not knowing impurity

22:15.959 --> 22:21.965
Those souls that win through
The darkness can only reach

22:22.049 --> 22:26.636
Obtain that eternity

22:26.720 --> 22:32.517
There's a feeling here
That doesn't know demise

22:32.601 --> 22:37.647
Speak your dream, you strong one

22:37.731 --> 22:43.445
A resound congratulating tune of eternity

22:43.528 --> 22:49.076
Into the light that governs the sky

22:49.159 --> 22:53.371
In the corner of the world that is messy

22:53.455 --> 22:57.626
A blade of a sword
That still wriggles and resists

22:57.709 --> 23:03.799
Grovels and struggles miserably

23:06.009 --> 23:07.094
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC NO. 2

23:07.803 --> 23:10.138
This time, I'll tell you about Giyu.

23:10.222 --> 23:12.057
I won't eat more soba.

23:12.140 --> 23:14.434
Yeah, me too. Don't worry.

23:15.310 --> 23:17.771
And here is the Taisho period secret.

23:17.854 --> 23:19.481
It's about Giyu's haori.

23:19.564 --> 23:22.234
As you can see,
half of it is a memento of Sabito.

23:22.317 --> 23:25.737
And half of it
is a memento of his sister Tsutako,

23:25.821 --> 23:27.697
who was killed by a demon.

23:27.781 --> 23:30.826
Giyu is a compassionate person, after all.

23:30.909 --> 23:33.912
Tanjiro, do you want to eat
simmered salmon with daikon?

23:33.995 --> 23:35.288
Are you sure?

23:35.372 --> 23:37.374
No eating contest this time.

23:37.457 --> 23:38.458
I'll accompany you!

23:38.542 --> 23:39.376
PHEW

23:39.459 --> 23:40.460
But before that!

23:40.544 --> 23:41.711
Next up on Episode 3:

23:41.795 --> 23:44.798
"Tanjiro is Fully Recovered and
Taking the Hashira Training!"

23:44.881 --> 23:46.049
TO BE CONTINUED
